@startuml st-storage-unit
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam dpi 150
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam roundcorner 6

title State Machine Diagram — StorageUnit Entity (6 States)

[*] --> AVAILABLE : Facility unit initial onboarding\n/ FacilityService#createUnit

AVAILABLE --> RESERVED : FM allocates unit to confirmed reservation\n[Contract created with PENDING_CHECK_IN]\n/ UnitAssignmentService#assignUnit (BR-AVL-04)
AVAILABLE --> MAINTENANCE : FM/Staff schedules regular preventive maintenance\n/ StorageUnitService#setMaintenance
AVAILABLE --> OUT_OF_SERVICE : Severe physical defect or structural decommission\n/ StorageUnitService#decommissionUnit

RESERVED --> OCCUPIED : Handover completed & contract activated\n[Handover protocol signed]\n/ HandoverService#completeCheckIn (BR-CHK-03)
RESERVED --> AVAILABLE : Check-in cancelled or reservation expired\n/ ReservationService#cancelReservation / UnitAssignmentService#unassign

OCCUPIED --> CLEANING : Checkout inspection completed upon unit return\n[Protocol signed, customer vacates unit]\n/ ReturnService#completeInspection (BR-RET-09)
OCCUPIED --> MAINTENANCE : Critical defect reported during active rental\n/ SupportService#flagUnitMaintenance

CLEANING --> AVAILABLE : Facility staff finishes sanitization & trash clearance\n/ StorageUnitService#completeCleaning (BR-RET-09)
CLEANING --> RESERVED : Pre-assigned to immediate future pending check-in\n/ UnitAssignmentService#assignUnit
CLEANING --> MAINTENANCE : Cleaning staff identifies physical defect needing repair\n/ StorageUnitService#setMaintenance

MAINTENANCE --> AVAILABLE : Maintenance and inspection repairs completed\n/ StorageUnitService#completeMaintenance
MAINTENANCE --> RESERVED : Repaired unit allocated to pending reservation\n/ UnitAssignmentService#assignUnit
MAINTENANCE --> CLEANING : Repairs finished, requires final post-work cleaning\n/ StorageUnitService#setCleaning
MAINTENANCE --> OUT_OF_SERVICE : Damage beyond repair / permanent unit retirement\n/ StorageUnitService#decommissionUnit

OUT_OF_SERVICE --> MAINTENANCE : Restoration project initiated\n/ StorageUnitService#restoreToMaintenance
OUT_OF_SERVICE --> AVAILABLE : Reconditioned and certified safe for rental\n/ StorageUnitService#recommissionUnit

OUT_OF_SERVICE --> [*] : Physical unit demolished / permanently removed
@enduml

